Bind Npc 29073 Zone 71
Quest 807 "[Crack of All Means] Stop Crack of All Means"
    Journal "You must accept the request of the [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus."
    Kill 1 of 9276 at direction_1035

Requires player level >= 59 and player is elmorad and quest 805 is completed

Rewards
    Give 25000000 experience

direction_1035 = location "[Field Boss] Shadow of Krowaz " about "Defeat ringleader of crevice" found "Crevice of resources(Instance Dungeon)" at 0 0

On available
    Say "Huff Huff ... This must be the final battle. But we don't even know whom we need to fight! I'm kinda scared. Let's visit Marcus."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "ah you are here. We're at the final stage."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The answer is to get rid of the main culprit. I'm asking you to do this, <selfname>. Destroy [Crack] and it's main culprit. And come back.\n\nMove to where the cracking happened and destruct the crack. \n※ Tip: Once you start attacking there, there might be monsters."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't destroyed the main culprit?"
    Topic "[Enter Dungeon]" do
        Enter instance 81 set 2 at 204 197

On claimable
    Show quest "Oh you are done! [Krowaz Shadow].. Finally Krowaz has been awaken.\n\nGood job. But now you'll need to defeat Krowaz. We'll do our best as well."
